. Help the swan reach the exit as you uncover a touching story of family, loss and grief.","steam_appid":3265290,"support_info":{"email":"businessgoosestudio@gmail.com","url":"https://www.businessgoose.be/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.businessgoose.be/"}